OL,3,GNEWSAMan pushed police officer off
OL,4,Amotorbike at protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who admitted pushing a police
OL,7,Fofficer off his motorcycle during an
OL,8,Fanti-migrant protest has been warned he
OL,9,Ffaces a jail sentence.
OL,11,FAbout 200 people gathered near Eastney
OL,12,FMarina when a boat carrying about 120
OL,13,Fmigrants was brought ashore after
OL,14,Fcrossing the Channel at nearby Eastney
OL,15,FBeach on 6 September.
OL,17,FNigel Wylie, 54, from Havant, admitted
OL,18,Fa charge of violent disorder at
OL,19,FPortsmouth Crown Court. He was remanded
OL,20,Fin custody and will be sentenced at the
OL,21,Fsame court on 27 November.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
